<title>UK: Car Group Plc to float shares at 138p.</title>
<headline>Car Group Plc to float shares at 138p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Car Group Plc, a West Midlands-based used car retailer, said on Thursday it would float at 138p.</p>
<p>The placing, by broker Charterhouse Tilney Securities, values the company at 43.1 million stg and will raise 20.1 million stg net of expenses.</p>
<p>The company will use the proceeds from the float for expansion and has plans to open eleven sites over the next five years. Dealing in the shares is expected to commence on Thursday, November 28.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
